# The answer key records a byte OFFSET for every reference. A line-ending conversion on
# checkout would shift every offset in every text file, and the self-check would report a
# tree/key mismatch — blaming the tree for something git did on the way out of the object
# store.
#
# `-text` turns every conversion off: what was committed is what lands in the working
# tree, on every platform. The repository root sets `* text=auto eol=lf`, which would
# otherwise apply here.
* -text
